# TZ-256 — Capability-aware routes and navigation

**Дата создания:** 2026-07-31
**Автор:** senior-orchestrator
**Приоритет:** HIGH (UX-only enforcement; server is TZ-255)
**ЗАВИСИМОСТИ:** TZ-255, TZ-252
**LAYER:** 3 (frontend) + 1 small backend route metadata endpoint
**CONFLICT KEYS:**
- frontend/src/app/core/capabilities/capabilities.service.ts (NEW)
- frontend/src/app/core/capabilities/has-permission.ts (helper)
- frontend/src/app/core/capabilities/capabilities.metadata.ts (route→capability map)
- frontend/src/app/app.routes.ts (+ data: { capabilities } on sensitive routes)
- frontend/src/app/layout/app-layout.component.ts (nav filter)
- frontend/src/app/shared/ui/forbidden/forbidden.page.ts (NEW — single forbidden state)

---

## 0. Цель

- Typed `hasPermission()`/capability service.
- Route metadata: `data: { capabilities: ['user:admin'] }` — declarative.
- Navigation metadata: каждый nav item имеет `capabilities`.
- Direct URL denial: route loader / guard читает metadata → если user no capability → redirect to `/forbidden` (NOT 404, чтобы не leak).
- Single forbidden state (не 13 разных страниц).
- Различие 401 (re-login) vs 403 (capability missing).
- `/kit/*` остаётся публичным showcase (TZ-92b).

**Не размножать `if (role === 'admin')` по страницам. Все гадалки через `HasPermission.check('user:admin')`.**

---

## 1. Архитектурное решение

### ШАГ 1: Capabilities service

`frontend/src/app/core/capabilities/capabilities.service.ts`:
- Signal `permissions: Set<string>` empty init.
- After login (`AuthService.user()` устанавливается), resolve permissions:
  - Если `user.role === 'admin'` ИЛИ `user.permissions?.includes('*')` → все canonical keys (получить из `/api/permissions/catalog`).
  - Иначе: union `role.permissions ∪ user.permissions`.
- `hasPermission(key: PermissionKey): boolean` — pure read.

### ШАГ 2: Route metadata + guard

`app.routes.ts`:
- На sensitive routes в operational section:
  - `data: { capabilities: ['user:write'] }` — admin-only product page.
- Frontend `CanMatchFn`: `capabilityRouteGuard` reads route data, defers to `capabilitiesService.hasPermission()`.

### ШАГ 3: Navigation metadata

`frontend/src/app/layout/app-layout.component.ts`:
- `navItems: Signal<NavItem[]>` — appended к existing.
- `NavItem { label, route, icon?, capabilities?: PermissionKey[] }`.
- `visibleNavItems = computed(() => navItems().filter(...))` — filter по capabilities.
- Lazy: per capabilities graceful degradation (skip reactive computation if no user).

### ШАГ 4: Forbidden state

`frontend/src/app/shared/ui/forbidden/forbidden.page.ts`:
- Single page with role-aware messaging: «У вас нет доступа к этому разделу».
- Возможно action: «Вернуться на главную» (routerLink `/`).
- При попытке прямой URL с no capability → redirect to `/forbidden` (NO 404 — не leak о существовании маршрута).

### ШАГ 5: 401 vs 403 differentiation

Frontend:
- 401 → автоматический redirect to `/login` (AuthGuard, existing).
- 403 → автоматический redirect to `/forbidden` (capability guard).
- AuthService.user() === null + 401 → bounce to /login.
- AuthService.user() не null + server 403 → bounce to /forbidden.

### ШАГ 6: Kit showcase exemption

`/kit/*` routes — НЕ имеют `data: { capabilities }`. Продолжают публичный доступ (TZ-92b).

### ШАГ 7: Tests

- Unit `capabilities.service.spec.ts`:
  - admin user → все keys;
  - user без permissions → empty set, hasPermission → false;
  - union role + user permissions;
  - wildcard expansion.
- Unit `capabilityRouteGuard.spec.ts`:
  - route data empty → bypass;
  - route data has cap → guard проверка;
  - no permission → redirectUrl `/forbidden`.
- Unit `navigation-filter.spec.ts`:
  - navItems filter по capabilities;
  - items без capabilities всегда видны;
  - admin sees everything.
- DOM-contract TestBed:
  - `/users` page (admin only) — admin login → рендерится, user login → redirect на `/forbidden`.

